list.item:
analytic: a text with its own title in a larger publication, a council in a volume of councils,
        an article in a journal; its title is level a, and it names its own author or editor where it has
        one;

biblScope in monogr, typed by its unit page, says where the text of
        the analytic stands in the volume: Aachen's council at pages 307 to 464 of the MGH's volume. It's part
        of the publication's description, and the import relates the text to the volume by it;
